# Grants the plugdev group control access to the VIA Labs VL812 USB2.0 hub
# (2109:2812) on this host, so uhubctl can power-cycle its ports without
# root. Used for VisionCB-8M-STD's SEGGER J-Link probe (port 1, recovered
# when it drops off the bus or wedges -- see run_visioncb_hil.py's
# recover_probe()). NUCLEO-F446RE's ST-LINK sits on port 3 of the same hub
# but must NOT be power-cycled this way -- see usb_hub_power.py.
SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="2109", ATTR{idProduct}=="2812", MODE="0664", GROUP="plugdev"
